  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creation and Dissemination of the Misak People&apos;s Peace-building Strategy in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guambia is one of a cohort of (IAF) grantee partners that will support peace-building efforts at the grassroots level. Guambia will convene a series of meetings and workshops in 19 cabildos (indigenous associations) to discuss and analyze the ongoing peace negotiations and, through a participatory process, create a post conflict strategy for Misak indigenous communities. The project will directly benefit 200 persons, and will indirectly benefit 26,000 indigenous community members.</narrative>
  </description>
